  "description": "Pure C# high-performance MySQL ADO.NET driver. Zero third-party dependencies, full async/await, Pipelined Batch Execution for 2~3× faster batch DML. MIT license. Supports net45~net10, MySQL 5.x~9.0+, OceanBase, TiDB, Doris, Aurora, CloudSQL; NativeAOT compatible on net8.0+; OpenTelemetry-compatible tracing (ActivitySource) on net6.0+.",
